# qmldir — explicit module manifest for modules/launcher/ (quick task
# 260822-sht, Task 1). Mirrors every sibling module manifest's own standing
# instruction (modules/qmldir:1-11, modules/dashboard/qmldir,
# modules/settings/qmldir): checking this file in disables Quickshell's
# directory-scanner synthesis for this directory entirely — any .qml type
# added here that is NOT declared below becomes unresolvable to shell.qml's
# `import "modules/launcher"` forever, with no load error. Any FUTURE type
# added to this directory (Tasks 2-9 each add one or more) MUST be declared
# in the SAME commit that creates it.
#
# LauncherState carries BOTH `pragma Singleton` in its own file AND the
# `singleton` keyword here — modules/qmldir's binary-verified finding:
# without the qmldir keyword, bare `LauncherState.query`-style access
# resolves to `undefined` forever (the object is never constructed).
# Launcher is deliberately NOT a singleton — it is the PanelWindow instance
# mounted once by shell.qml's launcherLoader, matching Dashboard/Overview's
# own non-singleton shape in the parent modules/qmldir.
#
# CalcMode/WebSearchMode/FilesMode (quick task 260822-sht, Task 2) are
# plain Item-rooted mode result views, loaded by Launcher.qml's results
# Loader — same non-singleton shape as Launcher itself. `fuzzy.js` needs NO
# entry here: only `.qml` TYPES require qmldir registration; a plain
# `import "fuzzy.js" as Fuzzy` relative-path JS import resolves without one
# (fuzzy.js's own header note).
#
# MenuTree (quick task 260822-sht, Task 3) is a singleton — a static data
# model, same rationale as LauncherState: `pragma Singleton` in-source AND
# the `singleton` keyword here, or bare `MenuTree.roots` access resolves to
# `undefined` forever. MenuMode is a plain Item-rooted mode result view,
# same non-singleton shape as CalcMode/WebSearchMode/FilesMode above.
module qs.modules.launcher
singleton LauncherState 1.0 LauncherState.qml
singleton MenuTree 1.0 MenuTree.qml
Launcher 1.0 Launcher.qml
CalcMode 1.0 CalcMode.qml
WebSearchMode 1.0 WebSearchMode.qml
FilesMode 1.0 FilesMode.qml
MenuMode 1.0 MenuMode.qml
